# Normalize line endings to LF everywhere.
#
# Every tracked file is already stored with LF, prettier is configured with
# endOfLine: lf, and CI runs on Linux. Without this, a developer with
# core.autocrlf=true checks out CRLF, prettier rewrites those files on every
# pre-commit run, and they are left showing as modified with an empty diff.
* text=auto eol=lf
